==Battleground==
*5 [[Celeboodle]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 60~63.33 seconds<sup>1,800f~1,900f</sup>.
*1 [[Sir Rel]] spawns after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*2 [[Suidae Piggicus|Suidae Piggici]] spawn after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>, delay 133.33~136.67 seconds<sup>4,000f~4,100f</sup>.
*1 [[Pterowl Hazuku]] spawns after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Sir Rel]]s spawn after 90 seconds<sup>2,700f</sup>, delay 60~63.33 seconds<sup>1,800f~1,900f</sup>.
*1 [[Infernal Pegasus Deonil]] spawns as the boss after 93.33 seconds<sup>2,800f</sup>.
*1 [[Mr. Puffington]] spawns after 160 seconds<sup>4,800f</sup>.

==Strategy==
It is recommended to [[cheese]] this stage by rushing down the Celeboodle quickly with [[Slime Cat (Rare Cat)|Jelly Dumpling Cat]] and [[Express Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Bullet Train Cat]] for starting cash, then sending out [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] and a fast meatshield unit that [[resistant|resists]] [[:Category:Alien Enemies|Alien enemies]]/[[:Category:Behemoth Enemies|Behemoths]], with [[Ancient Egg: N108 (Super Rare Cat)|Soap Cat]], [[Ancient Egg: N112 (Rare Cat)|Cat Egg Pod]], [[Jetpack Cat (Rare Cat)|Jetpack Cat]] and [[Curling Cat (Rare Cat)|Green Shell Cat]] all being great at filling this role. [[Crazed Tank Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic Eraser]] can also work, though a Defense UP [[Cat Combo|Combo]] should be used alongside it to ensure consistency. This will help rush down the base and stall the enemies, but be wary of Hazuku, who will require high accuracy in timing your units. Awakened Bahamut should be able to stay inside Pterowl Hazuku's blindspot and safely destroy the base before Infernal Pegasus Deonil spawns, just beware that Suidae Piggicus may hit Bahamut if you time the meatshield incorrectly.

However, it is very possible to take this stage head-on if you have UL [[True Form]]s by now, specifically Naala. Use the Celeboodles at the beginning to send out Naala, and spam [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]] along with other attackers like [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can]] to get rid of the Suidae Piggicus by any means necessary to allow access into Hazuku's blind spot. If you're lucky, Naala will survive for long enough to actually kill the Piggicus, but more often than not she will die. Once Piggicus is dead, lure Hazuku close to your base (but not close enough where he's damaging it) and spam all of your attackers to kill him before Deonil reaches you. Once Hazuku is dead, the only threat left is Puffington, although you can deal with him easily with [[Idi:N (Special Cat)|Idi]]. After Puffington falls, the hardest part of this stage is trying not to fall asleep as your Couriers slowly kill Deonil despite his freeze waves.

